  "label": "User projected onto the celebratory toast scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene of the woman toasting with champagne, as the toast is used as a metaphor for celebrating intellectual flexibility. The act of toasting directly addresses the viewer, inviting them to participate in the celebration of open-mindedness. The text 'cheers to all the people' explicitly includes 'all the people', which includes the viewer, creating a direct address and projection of the user onto the scene.",
